      "entries": [
        "Hezle throws a mix of special powders centered on a corner of her space, creating a plume of smoke filling a 5-foot burst until the end of her turn that causes her to be hidden. She then immediately Sneaks, but must end her movement in a space that's not adjacent to any enemies. All creatures other than Hezle in the smoke cloud must attempt a DC 26 Fortitude save."
      ],
